      "label": "General assessment of real estate. Assessed units (type codes 220, 223, 225, 223), total assessed value in 2023, total assessed value in 2024, weighted and un-weighted change by region and type code. Year 2024",
      "source": "Statistics Sweden",
      "updated": "2025-03-05T07:00:00Z",
      "link": {
        "related": [
          {
            "extension": {
